      "cooked": "<p>So the Slaughterhouse 6 cards are confusing me.</p><p>some refer to \"nemesis cards.\" &nbsp;Some refers to \"cards with nemesis icons,\" and Ray Manta's card says \"each nemesis.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>which is what? Which ones include character cards, and which don't?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>does Glamour redirect damage targeting Villain Character cards? Who does hunting pack heal (this one seems pretty clear, but I want to make sure)? If Omni-X is in the game and components are out, who is healed by Ray Manta?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>thnaks!</p>",
