      "created_at": "2016-01-22T15:50:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When it says \"Each Nemesis\", or \"Redirect damage from a Nemesis\", it's refering to cards with the Nemessis key word on them (Glamour, Ray Manta, Magman, Cueball, etc...). Card that have Nemesis icons on them but don't have the key word aren't effected.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit: Ninja Ronway.</p>",
