      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-22T16:55:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks, all.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ray Manta was the most confusing, because Villain character cards are nemeses (or maybe it's better to think that they <em>have</em> nemeses).</p><p>Anyway, Glamour specifies nemesis&nbsp;<em>cards</em>,&nbsp;so I thought maybe referring to just \"nemesis\" also included villain character cards, since otherwise Ray Manta would have said \"each nemesis card\" like Glamour.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Glad it doesn't!</p>",
